# Portfolio creative (Ahmed Mostafa)

Brussels-based. 11+ years across IT, full-stack, strategic marketing, consulting. Audience: HR directors, C-level, business owners in Europe. Primary conversion: **Download CV**.

**This is a cinematic documentary, not a resume page.** Editorial noir meets data intelligence (Bloomberg Terminal, Nils Frahm, Guardian longform, A24). Dominant pillar: **STORY** — narrative arc and human stakes; data/cinematic support the story.

**Rules:** One accent color max (ember); everything else tonal. The NAME is the logo — it transforms. Motion serves meaning, not decoration. Each section: ONE thing the visitor remembers.

**Never:** generic dev-portfolio aesthetics, purple-on-white, Inter/Roboto/Arial, hero-photo+text-left, skill bars, cookie-cutter grids, narrating code comments.
